# Chiara Picarelli, DCMC - Politecnico di Milano
# chiara.picarelli@polimi.it
# https://github.com/cippee/utils
# September 2026
#
# Come orbital-style ma level 0.004: le densita' di Fukui sono piccole,
# a 0.02 non si vede nulla.
# Uso:  open fukui.cube  ->  open fukui-style.cxc  ->  open fukui-snapshots.cxc

style ball
color byelement
hide pseudobonds

graphics silhouettes true width 2.0 color black

lighting depthCue true
lighting depthCueColor black
lighting depthCueStart 0.5
lighting depthCueEnd 1.5

# lighting: resa approssimata di Chimera, da rifinire a occhio
lighting
lighting intensity 0.85
material specularReflectivity 0.5
material exponent 128

volume #1 step 1 style surface level -0.004 level 0.004 color #4f76ff color #ff141d
transparency #1 20 target s

view
